            <div xml:id="m-94cc429b-ca44-491f-835e-28b86d614219">
              <lg xml:id="m-0bc357e3-757b-442e-ad13-67e293b9a5bb">
                <l xml:id="m-e55aeffe-708a-4a5a-b1cd-c3816f168e11" facs="#m-926fb849-4fc3-49f4-9a6e-43b0b7cafb24" label="text-like">for Feasts which are not I. class.</l><l xml:id="m-2193f2f9-9aa4-417a-b621-b76526e2ff28" facs="#m-f8fee8b3-348e-4976-9cc7-87001007941a" label="ambiguous">2797</l><l xml:id="m-cb04c281-cb07-417a-8c3c-332c68c03641" facs="#m-7d5b9a5a-19f7-4bf9-a350-f9a50c9209f5" label="text-like">SATURDAY AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-dda7bb4b-ae81-4368-8352-5b31948bcd6d" facs="#m-4187e5c1-ecaf-442d-84e0-488561210d05" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-74a06ee0-68fd-4fee-b198-d2b32b7e08d0" facs="#m-26e6ff35-42a6-4a7a-9f01-6c75a6f5697e" label="ambiguous">S.6</l><l xml:id="m-2833a938-89c3-4817-8aa7-8ba49708f906" facs="#m-a5396754-1364-4aed-ab10-94c1a923cf1a" label="lyrics-like">DOmi-ne Dé-us mé-us. Eu oua e</l><l xml:id="m-420ca37b-2644-4949-be6b-9b9e852f1555" facs="#m-eb585844-31dc-45ca-9f94-c7f7d53991b7" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time. Ant. Allelúia. p. 241.</l><l xml:id="m-1f35216f-6aa6-4d22-b8cc-41f4e41d1dd2" facs="#m-a1491f2f-5696-46ad-b3c6-a8c5d8d04bf0" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 13. I. Bénedic, ánima méa. VV. 1-13 p. 871.</l><l xml:id="m-8ca16e8a-33cb-4d49-9996-67bc73c15ec7" facs="#m-0f118045-e80f-4be0-827e-b60977c1744b" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 103. H. Rigans móntes. YY. 14-24.</l><l xml:id="m-ce676232-901d-4c7d-95a8-ccd3763746b6" facs="#m-ad30da72-3a4f-4fbf-b2dc-5769730995e4" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 103. I1. Quam magnificáta sunt. VV. 25-38.</l><l xml:id="m-1547b086-46da-4a5f-832a-d76abe4a9033" facs="#m-9626e2b8-c4c9-4c98-a4eb-33526753f4c6" label="ambiguous">An¬</l><l xml:id="m-c4f2ab9a-212b-4d5a-8212-81540b6492a9" facs="#m-abe11731-3cd3-4fb3-a2ae-1d6f7372dd86" label="ambiguous">tiphon.</l><l xml:id="m-f13bfdbc-78fc-4ea2-afc6-0c4a3ee09cac" facs="#m-26c57374-88e1-47be-8282-5f09b326d43b" label="lyrics-like">Dómi-ne Dé-us mé-us, magni-fi-cátus es vehe¬</l><l xml:id="m-907a9eb4-97f0-456c-9876-db82f70ae567" facs="#m-40ad0989-942a-4809-8f9c-7c09abe33e7a" label="lyrics-like">ménter.</l><l xml:id="m-815bf6a7-7275-4b2e-99b4-6b8e93201aa2" facs="#m-3780e95c-66e1-414e-a809-caf54d6a75b3" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time. Ant. Allelúia, alleluia, allelúia. p. 244.</l><l xml:id="m-a89bcc48-8ad2-4ad3-bb4f-c378c81d5fb6" facs="#m-134590a3-4eba-4517-b186-8ad363195503" label="text-like">SATURDAY AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-d9578191-6e89-4df1-9f9e-23a62a92464d" facs="#m-485b7736-631d-4e5a-b120-70fc0f1994b0" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-09fbc8d4-7c47-47c0-bfa3-ecca438706fc" facs="#m-c48c753e-3c21-4fb4-9a58-e2f0d323588b" label="ambiguous">1.1</l><l xml:id="m-d91369dc-702b-498d-be9d-97b1ec8b60bb" facs="#m-b1b8d65b-742c-403c-be8a-7c56864dfc34" label="lyrics-like">E tacú-e-ris, Dé-us. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-5da754ca-438e-4bba-97cf-6018d691a6c4" facs="#m-db4c1fd0-5e77-44f9-9c77-3669a40c4cc2" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time. Ant. Allelúia. p. 246.</l><l xml:id="m-f2a70fa9-ee8e-420f-b8a8-c7c3389dbf5b" facs="#m-4e0bd818-36e9-4b46-b8bf-5f8f109c8acc" label="ambiguous">Psalm 108. I.</l><l xml:id="m-11cd3034-f324-4193-8bd9-5a2cfc4b5258" facs="#m-7820170a-1a48-4a37-801e-16561eb07989" label="lyrics-like">Eus, laudem méam ne taeúeris: *quia os peccatóris, et os dolósi</l><l xml:id="m-77b2dba4-dde0-4b0b-b529-33c347f6477d" facs="#m-71a64fed-449f-4645-97b8-9e5e7c7858df" label="lyrics-like">Osuper me apértum est.</l><l xml:id="m-74e55198-61bf-4bb4-9d2e-1f708ac2e81c" facs="#m-17f92fc7-46ed-475e-bd79-ad3815d62fa4" label="lyrics-like">2. Locúti sunt advérsum me lingua dolósa, t et sermónibus ódir</l><l xml:id="m-a2c1006c-fb66-4e48-8c6b-2aaa9f69d3c3" facs="#m-2f984506-d713-4ef9-9356-464d8d504328" label="lyrics-like">cireumdedérunt me:* et expugnavérunt me grátis.</l><l xml:id="m-4c0c8bf9-f4b9-4139-9be6-ed6b462d54e6" facs="#m-e287f1b0-ece5-4310-8968-5de9d24b0714" label="lyrics-like">3. Pro éo ut me diligerent, detrahébant mihi : “ égo autem orábam.</l><l xml:id="m-193a968f-170a-45aa-b2d6-a3969548019b" facs="#m-1d2af029-e3e9-499d-97f7-e7f0a7b154a6" label="lyrics-like">4. Et posuérunt advérsum me mâla pro bónis: * et ódium pro</l><l xml:id="m-baab86c2-e130-43d4-b0a2-48894b3d7f93" facs="#m-30d81b53-b529-43ea-ba70-dd9caa9200b8" label="lyrics-like">dilectióne méa.</l><l xml:id="m-f6860a45-41ad-4437-86ea-3f6b32233408" facs="#m-dd0ea14c-5e24-477f-b0a6-37b495c92b21" label="lyrics-like">5. Constítue super éum peecatórem :* et diábolus stet a déxtris éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-47ef6eb4-6de3-4324-a098-33206768c722" facs="#m-97b04a95-c00d-4697-bcb1-211dec9ccb16" label="lyrics-like">6. Cum judicátur, éxeat condemnátus: * et orátio éjus fiat in</l><l xml:id="m-d82300c5-d1f8-49f5-88c5-e292524c6114" facs="#m-3ef06b77-5ec3-45d6-9e22-d012e19c6bfa" label="lyrics-like">peceâtum.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
